DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppggmmtteexxttuurree  reads a PGM image as input and calculates textural features
       based on spatial dependence matrices at 0, 45, 90, and 135 degrees  for
       a distance _d (default = 1).

       Textural features include:



       •      Angular Second Moment

       •      Contrast

       •      Correlation

       •      Variance

       •      Inverse Difference Moment

       •      Sum Average

       •      Sum Variance

       •      Sum Entropy

       •      Entropy

       •      Difference Variance

       •      Difference Entropy

       •      Information Measures of Correlation

       •      Maximal Correlation Coefficient



